  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_01",
      "hash": "fb4676393b4acf3b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：啊！\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_02",
      "hash": "fb4677393b4ad0ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]你也想\\n见识见识[VAR COLOR(0006)]宝可梦联盟[VAR COLOR(0000)]吗？\\c\\n那是个可以与训练家中\\n最强的[VAR COLOR(0006)]四天王[VAR COLOR(0000)]对战的地方！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_03",
      "hash": "fb4678393b4ad2a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "虽说我真的很想\\n亲眼见见四天王……\\c\\n但他们说要有宝可梦道馆的\\n徽章才行，所以不让我过去！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_04",
      "hash": "fb4679393b4ad454",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "算了。看来只能踏踏实实地\\n让自己变强了。\\c\\n那么，[VAR TRNAME(0000)]！\\n我们也踏踏实实地比试一下吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_05",
      "hash": "fb467a393b4ad607",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……我也算是\\n为[VAR TRNAME(0000)]变强出力了，\\r\\n算了，就这样吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0150_rival_06",
      "hash": "fb467b393b4ad7ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "为了有朝一日能一起前往宝可梦联盟，\\n你和我都要好好努力啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_field_r022",
      "hash": "3d688bba617b3f65",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
